<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <title>Onboarding Successful</title>
        <style>
            body {
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.6;
                color:black;
                background-color: #f8f9fa;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
            }
            .email-container {
                max-width: 600px;
                margin: 20px auto;
                background: #ffffff;
                border: 2px solid black;
                border-radius: 8px;
                overflow: hidden;
            }
            .email-header {
                background-color: #000000;
                color: #ffffff;
                padding: 20px;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .email-header h1 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 24px;
            }
            .email-body {
                padding: 20px;
            }
            .email-body h2 {
                margin-top: 0;
                color: #000000;
            }
            .email-footer {
                background-color: #f1f1f1;
                padding: 10px;
                text-align: center;
                font-size: 12px;
                border-top: 1px solid black;
                color: #989898;
            }
            .button {
                display: inline-block;
                margin-top: 20px;
                padding: 10px 20px;
                background-color: #efac0f;
                color: black;
                font-weight: bold;
                text-decoration: none;
                border-radius: 5px;
                font-size: 16px;
                border:2px solid black;
                box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px black;
            }
            .button:hover {
                background-color: #b88f3b;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="email-container">
            <div class="email-header">
                <h1>Welcome to AIcademy!</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="email-body">
                <h2>Congratulations, <%= firstName %> 🎉</h2>
                <p>
                    We’re thrilled to inform you that your onboarding process
                    has been successfully completed. You’re now officially part
                    of our teaching community.
                </p>
                <p>Here’s what you can do next:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Create engaging courses and share your knowledge with
                        learners worldwide.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Access our tools to manage your courses and track
                        student progress.
                    </li>
                    <li>Connect with a community of passionate educators.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    We’re excited to see you create amazing learning
                    experiences. If you have any questions or need assistance,
                    feel free to reach out to our support team.
                </p>
                <a
                    href="http://localhost:5173/"
                    style="color: black;"
                    class="button"
                    >Go to Your Dashboard</a
                >
            </div>
            <div class="email-footer">
                <p>
                    Thank you for choosing AIcademy. Together, let’s shape the
                    future of education!
                </p>
                <p>
                    &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> AIcademy. All rights
                    reserved.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
